<% locals.layout = 'layout' %>
<div class="container" style="padding:40px 0 70px;max-width:820px">

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px">
    <span style="display:inline-block;background:var(--secondary);color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.3rem .8rem;border-radius:50px">Legal</span>
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align:center;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.4rem);font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:.4em 0 .3em">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin:0 0 34px">Last updated: 8 August 2026</p>

  <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 30px;color:var(--mid);font-size:.97rem;line-height:1.85">

    <p>MathStudy.in sells downloadable mathematics e-books. This page explains, in plain language, what information we collect when you use the site and what we do with it. We collect the minimum we need to deliver your books and run the shop — nothing more.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">Information we collect</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0">
      <li><strong>Account details</strong> — your name, email address and a securely hashed password when you register.</li>
      <li><strong>Order details</strong> — the books you buy, the price paid and your UPI payment reference, so we can verify the payment and deliver your download.</li>
      <li><strong>Support messages</strong> — whatever you send us through the contact or support forms, including a WhatsApp number or email if you provide one, so we can reply.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — we use Google Analytics to understand which pages are visited. This is aggregate data; we do not use it to identify you personally.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">How we use it</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0">
      <li>To deliver the e-books you purchase (your download link is sent to your email and saved in your dashboard).</li>
      <li>To verify UPI payments and prevent fraudulent orders.</li>
      <li>To answer your questions and resolve order issues.</li>
      <li>To improve the site based on which pages and books people find useful.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">What we never do</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0">
      <li>We do not sell, rent or share your personal information with anyone for marketing.</li>
      <li>We do not store card, bank or UPI credentials — payments happen entirely inside your own UPI app; we only see the reference number you share with us.</li>
      <li>We do not send marketing email you have not asked for.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a session cookie to keep you signed in and to remember your cart, and Google Analytics cookies for anonymous usage statistics. You can clear or block cookies in your browser; the shop will still work, though you will need to sign in again.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">How long we keep data</h2>
    <p>Order records are kept so that you can re-download your books at any time from your dashboard. If you would like your account and its data removed, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">Children</h2>
    <p>Our books are written for school students, but purchases and accounts are intended to be made by a parent, guardian or adult. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children beyond what is needed to deliver a purchase made on their behalf.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin:26px 0 8px">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy or your data: email <a href="mailto:admin@mathstudy.in" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">admin@mathstudy.in</a> or use the <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">contact page</a>. MathStudy.in is an initiative of <a href="https://vidaara.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600">vidaara.org</a>.</p>

  </div>
</div>
